==Old English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ang|mēu|mēw|mēau|mēaw}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*maiwiz}}, a byform of {{der|ang|gem-pro|*maiwaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|meau}}, {{m|fy|miuw}}, {{cog|osx|mēu}} ({{cog|gml|meve}}, from which {{cog|de|Möwe}}), {{cog|nl|meeuw}}, {{cog|non|már}}, {{m|non|mór}}.

